# Graphite UI

Treat `design.md` as law for `public/index.html`, `public/app.js`, and `public/app.css`.

- Keep the 44 / sidebar+log / 28 shell. Do not revive the card board or tab bar.
- Use the tokens in `design.md` exactly (colors, type, spacing, radii, heights).
- One primary action per zone; secondary work (worktrees, projects, presets, attention, env, edit) opens from `···` as overlay sheets.
- Stay vanilla JS + existing `/api/*` routes. No frameworks, no new palette or typeface.
- Keyboard-first: `↑↓`/`j`/`k`, `space`, `r`, `e`, `c`, `o`, `/`, `Esc`.
- Show error chips, resume-follow, and empty-state actions only when they apply.
